{"event_type":"review","id":"6c543e169ac54be252d18f5d675d8ae6e96b14bc4094b89e1261b76e599f6476","occurred_at":"2026-11-15T14:25:39Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/2e6cbb8a2d21ab01f0d79627f735373a2cbb86fe4d308d3ea8c0adb87c97f0a3","sha256":"2e6cbb8a2d21ab01f0d79627f735373a2cbb86fe4d308d3ea8c0adb87c97f0a3"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/c97a61ed20a5e9caf60c4f6bf12a4092b65da63dee2d685b022028858d8dfe03","sha256":"c97a61ed20a5e9caf60c4f6bf12a4092b65da63dee2d685b022028858d8dfe03"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ce72b1227c1d7a9812454ef281bb7a55df5663daa5f421f7e646b0154eec8988","sha256":"ce72b1227c1d7a9812454ef281bb7a55df5663daa5f421f7e646b0154eec8988"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/885aa5037d9522af54aea6150527eb322fb9b2aa62350802b57c8078202c9b7a","sha256":"885aa5037d9522af54aea6150527eb322fb9b2aa62350802b57c8078202c9b7a"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/cc0f2be4518e4abd3b6f547baeeaa915d288d0230710cb890d521c45dc3c4125","sha256":"cc0f2be4518e4abd3b6f547baeeaa915d288d0230710cb890d521c45dc3c4125"}],"attempt_id":"a9af9057e45c4d43766cafd8688b9597e74b042528cd514fabfa6643320ce8ee:0:1","base":"43c677bdd462f199e9315bc23c0a5a9d3f5e946d","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"2a63c7369662c2b398fd6e152834a444e9819e69","body":"**Mark each complete slot incomplete before the recovery shell starts.**\n\nThe recovery shell runs for every attached slot, including a slot whose metadata has `incomplete: false`. Nothing in the path before the shell clears or checks that flag. If the shell changes the checkout and exits unsuccessfully, the function throws before any metadata write, so the complete record remains for a checkout that was not reconciled.\n\nPersist `incomplete: true` on each valid record before the shell starts. The success path still writes the final state after reconciliation. Inspect mode also starts the shell, so a complete slot stays incomplete after an inspect run until a `retain` or `removed` run finishes.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n+    for (const [index, slot] of slots.entries()) {\n+      const value = metadata[index];\n+      if (value && value.incomplete === false) await slot.writeMetadata({ ...value, incomplete: true });\n+    }\n     const success = await io.shell(slots.map((slot) => slot.fd));\n```\n\n</details>","id":"100417ff00600037c7b4ad66d93c1972c4564d98a31cd4ddf0327ad3c0f5e4e7","intervals":[[90,90]],"path":"scripts/recover-review-checkout.mjs","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Mark each complete slot incomplete before the recovery shell starts."}],"head":"6640d0e46a9b3bb8ac947ca1d452fa72bcfb0068","head_tree":"1ecd116c4ac33bbae984033dfd03894947e6454f","input_scope":[{"blob":"2a63c7369662c2b398fd6e152834a444e9819e69","intervals":[[1,208]],"path":"scripts/recover-review-checkout.mjs"}],"job_id":"a9af9057e45c4d43766cafd8688b9597e74b042528cd514fabfa6643320ce8ee:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"2a63c7369662c2b398fd6e152834a444e9819e69","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"scripts/recover-review-checkout.mjs","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"2a63c7369662c2b398fd6e152834a444e9819e69","intervals":[[1,208]],"path":"scripts/recover-review-checkout.mjs"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"2a63c7369662c2b398fd6e152834a444e9819e69","intervals":[[1,208]],"path":"scripts/recover-review-checkout.mjs"}],"scope_digest":"53fa841d88739f4c624109d818beacef7aa4d2a7d2409bfde6eee616c36edc41","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"b